; The earlier postings an assignment subtracts include the transaction's
; own (src/textual_xacts.cc, compute_balance_diff), so a commodity first
; posted earlier in the same transaction also leaves a second commodity,
; and to_amount rejects the difference (src/balance.h:473-480).

2024/01/01 Open
    Assets:A    $10
    Equity:O

2024/01/02 Intra xact second commodity then bare zero
    Assets:A    5 EUR
    Assets:A    = 0
    Assets:B

test bal -> 1
